text:
taylor: Hey team — starting the relnotes/changelog draft for the docs push. Scope: snippet parity, redirect fixes, a short Dedicated migration blurb (routing policy v2), and one Known Issue. Draft PR: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/5235

zane: Running linkcheck now. Found a renamed anchor in /guides/quantization -> will add a redirect entry. Also spotted a stale link in /guides/migrate that points to old-routing.

olivia: Heads-up on i18n: fr/zh snippets have inconsistent placeholder ordering and some code-block rendering issues. Filing INTL-1201 and adding notes to the PR for translators.

mike: Snippet parity note: a handful of pages still use the legacy `client.generate(...)` pattern. We should standardize to `const client = new RedwoodClient(...)` + `await client.responses.create(...)` across examples.

sam: Agreed. Also recommend adding minimal try/catch examples where we show network calls. For Dedicated docs, include a small pinned-model example to clarify rollout behavior.

taylor: Known Issue to add: "Embeddings streaming may intermittently return 403 on long multi-chunk uploads." Workaround: set `batch_size: 1` and enable `prefix_cache`. Repro attached: EVAL-2024-11-01. Paste suggested troubleshooting snippet in PR.

sam: Suggested JS troubleshooting snippet to include in relnotes:
```javascript
const client = new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY });
try {
  const emb = await client.embeddings.create({
    model: "redwood-embed-1",
    input: longText,
    batch_size: 1,
    prefix_cache: true,
  });
  console.log(emb.data[0].embedding.length);
} catch (err) {
  console.error("Embeddings request failed", err);
}
```

zane: I'm opening the redirect PRs and will list all files touched in the relnotes PR description so translators see the final strings. PRs: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/5230 (redirects), https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/5231 (snippet sweep).

intl-bot: localization-check: placeholders normalized in 8/10 files; tickets created: INTL-1201, INTL-1202. Translators pinged.

deploy-bot: docs-build queued #601 — status: pending

olivia: Migration blurb (2 lines) suggestion for Dedicated: "Routing policy v2 changes fallback ordering to prefer lower-latency regional variants. Customers who pin model IDs should verify rollouts after upgrading and contact SE for assisted migration." Thoughts?

taylor: Looks good — keep it concise and add a direct link from the Dedicated page to the top-level changelog. Cutoff for localization: 2024-09-30 EOD UTC. Publish target: 2024-10-15 16:00 PT. Merge plan: batch snippet fixes into the relnotes PR to minimize churn.

sam: I'll assemble final JS + Python snippets and update the relnotes PR description with exact files changed. Ping me for copy edits before the freeze.

zane: Redirects + snippet sweep PRs opened, CI passed and merged. Added INTL notes to the relnotes PR.

taylor: Thanks everyone. Once intl thumbs-up is in I'll do a final copy pass and cut the release branch. :rocket:
